// Which maps the game has.
//
// Both are built every time: the 3D globe, and the flat map that wraps round for ever. A
// player switches between them with the map button or F2. Turn one off and the campaign opens
// on the other, never switches back, and the switch disappears. Turning both off keeps the
// globe.
{
  "GlobeMapEnabled": true,
  "FlatMapEnabled": true
}
